  - <ID>k__BackingField: c62ca95d-3903-4166-8554-13603e9f8d25
    <Name>k__BackingField: 5
    <Text>k__BackingField: Say, you wouldn't have five euros for the bus?
    <SpeakerName>k__BackingField: Officer Torrent
    <Choices>k__BackingField:
    - <Text>k__BackingField: Are you cosplaying?
      <NodeID>k__BackingField: 2b8cf2bd-9bf9-4ed3-ac5b-569394e62638
    - <Text>k__BackingField: Do you have some personal matters with someone?
      <NodeID>k__BackingField: 871ec4dc-6387-453e-a756-bf558bd7511a
    - <Text>k__BackingField: No, sorry. I don't have a penny
      <NodeID>k__BackingField: 5923e909-8e63-445e-a31b-92396898beee
    - <Text>k__BackingField: Goodbye
      <NodeID>k__BackingField: 76334ac2-79c8-4410-a0a1-ccb4e7dc41a7
    <GroupID>k__BackingField: 
